// Copy to Config/Local.xcconfig (git-ignored) to point Debug and Staging
// builds somewhere else on this machine only. Remember the $() between the
// slashes: xcconfig reads "//" as a comment.

// A Rails server on another computer on your network (bin/dev binds to
// 0.0.0.0 there):
// CWW_BASE_URL = http:/$()/192.168.1.20:3000
// and its host among the app-bound domains, or the bridge's scripts don't
// run on its pages:
// CWW_APP_BOUND_LOCAL_DOMAIN = 192.168.1.20
